<button onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('https://www.sarthakestates.com/ruparel-realty-kandivali-project/');this.textContent='✅ Copied!';setTimeout(()=>this.textContent=&#8217;🔗 Copy Link&#8217;,2000)&#8221; style=&#8221;background:#666;color:#fff;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:20px;border:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;&#8221;>🔗 Copy Link</button></div></div><div style="display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;color:#888;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:18px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;align-items:center;"><span>🕐 20 min read</span><span>📅 Updated: 27 Aug 2026</span><span>✍️ Sarthak Estates Research Team</span></div><p style="font-size:.85em;color:#666;border-left:3px solid #B8860B;padding-left:10px;margin-bottom:1.5em;"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> 27 August 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>By:</strong> Sarthak Estates Research Team</p><div class="sl-trust"><div class="sl-trust-item">✅ 17+ Years Experience</div><div class="sl-trust-item">🏆 1000+ Happy Clients</div><div class="sl-trust-item">🔑 Verified Listings</div><div class="sl-trust-item">📋 RERA Registered</div><div class="sl-trust-item">🆓 Free Consultation</div></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h1>Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West 2026: Price, 1 &amp; 2 BHK, Location, Amenities, Resale &amp; Investment Guide</h1><figure id="attachment_37854" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-37854" style="width: 300px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><a href="https://www.sarthakestates.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/Mumbai.jpeg"><img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIzMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMzAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgc3R5bGU9ImZpbGw6I2NmZDRkYjtmaWxsLW9wYWNpdHk6IDAuMTsiLz48L3N2Zz4=" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-37854" data-src="https://www.sarthakestates.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/Mumbai-300x200.jpeg.webp" alt="Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West 2026 Mumbai" width="300" height="200" data-srcset="https://www.sarthakestates.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/Mumbai-300x200.jpeg.webp 300w, https://www.sarthakestates.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/Mumbai-499x333.jpeg.webp 499w, https://www.sarthakestates.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/Mumbai.jpeg.webp 1536w" data-sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></a><figcaption id="caption-attachment-37854" class="wp-caption-text">Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West 2026 Mumbai</figcaption></figure><p><strong>Ruparel Codename West Park, Kandivali West, Mumbai</strong> is a residential development by Ruparel Realty in the established western suburbs of Mumbai. The project is particularly relevant for buyers searching for <strong>1 BHK and 2 BHK flats in Kandivali West</strong>, ready-to-move/resale homes, and properties with access to New Link Road, Kandivali railway station and Mumbai&#8217;s expanding Metro network.</p><p>A key point for buyers in 2026 is that much of the information circulating online about West Park originates from the project&#8217;s older launch-era marketing material. The original brochure describes the project as <strong>Codename West Park – Kandivali (West), Phase 1</strong>, with the site at <strong>CTS No. 471, Ekta Nagar, New Link Road, near Atharva College of Engineering, Kandivali West, Mumbai – 400067</strong>. (<a title="12X9_in_West Park Brochure" href="https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/1464348941931Codename-West-Park-_eBrochure.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Img StaticMB</a>)</p><div class="sl-cta-box"><h3>📞 Interested? Talk to a Property Expert</h3><p>17+ years of experience · Delhi, Noida, Gurgaon, Mumbai &#038; Dubai · Verified listings · Free consultation</p><div class="sl-cta-actions">
<a href="tel:+919958959555" class="sl-cta-call">📞 Call +91-9958-959-555</a>
<a href="https://wa.me/919958959555?text=Hi%21+I+read+about+Ruparel+Realty+Kandivali+project+on+your+website+and+want+more+details." class="sl-cta-wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">💬 WhatsApp</a></div></div><p>Current property-market data identifies approximately <strong>400 units</strong> and reported configurations of <strong>1 BHK and 2 BHK</strong>, with listed sizes of approximately <strong>667 sq ft, 815 sq ft and 1,072 sq ft</strong>. A current market database updated in March 2026 reported project-level average prices moving from approximately ₹32,700/sq ft to ₹34,900/sq ft during Q1 2026. These are market/portal figures—not a guaranteed price for every apartment. (<a title="Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West, Mumbai | Price List, Floor Plan, Reviews &amp; RERA Details" href="https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-codename-west-park/8557/project?utm_source=chatgpt.com">SquareYards</a>)</p><blockquote><p><strong>2026 buyer alert:</strong> Do not use the old ₹9,750/sq ft figure appearing in historical marketing material as today&#8217;s price. The original material is more than a decade old, and current market pricing is substantially different. Always obtain a unit-specific quotation and verify RERA carpet area, title, OC, parking and outstanding dues before purchasing.</p></blockquote><hr /><h2 id="toc-0-ruparel-codename-west-park-quick-facts">Ruparel Codename West Park – Quick Facts</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Property Detail</th><th>2026 Information</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Project</strong></td><td>Ruparel Codename West Park</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Developer</strong></td><td>Ruparel Realty</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Location</strong></td><td>Kandivali West, Mumbai</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Micro-market</strong></td><td>Ekta Nagar / New Link Road</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Project Type</strong></td><td>Residential apartments</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Reported Inventory</strong></td><td>Approximately 400 units</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Configurations</strong></td><td>1 BHK &amp; 2 BHK</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Reported Sizes</strong></td><td>~667, 815 &amp; 1,072 sq ft</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Project Status</strong></td><td>Current portals report ready-to-move</td></tr><tr><td><strong>PIN Code</strong></td><td>400067</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Key Road</strong></td><td>New Link Road</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Rail Connectivity</strong></td><td>Kandivali Railway Station</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Metro Connectivity</strong></td><td>Mumbai Metro network</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Developer</strong></td><td>Ruparel Realty</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Best suited for</strong></td><td>End-users, families, investors and resale buyers</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Current property data reports the 400-unit inventory and these three commonly listed configurations. (<a title="Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West, Mumbai | Price List, Floor Plan, Reviews &amp; RERA Details" href="https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-codename-west-park/8557/project?utm_source=chatgpt.com">SquareYards</a>)</p><hr /><h1>About Ruparel Codename West Park</h1><p>Ruparel Codename West Park was launched as a large residential development in <strong>Kandivali West</strong>, targeting buyers looking for relatively spacious homes combined with landscaped/open areas and lifestyle amenities.</p><p>The original brochure positioned the project around the concept of <strong>“Evergreen Living”</strong>, emphasising green surroundings, recreational facilities and connectivity. The documented site address was on New Link Road near Atharva College of Engineering. (<a title="12X9_in_West Park Brochure" href="https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/1464348941931Codename-West-Park-_eBrochure.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Img StaticMB</a>)</p><p>The project is particularly interesting in 2026 because Kandivali West has evolved into a mature residential micro-market with a combination of:</p><ul><li>Established residential communities</li><li>Schools and colleges</li><li>Hospitals</li><li>Retail and shopping</li><li>Restaurants and entertainment</li><li>Railway connectivity</li><li>Metro connectivity</li><li>New Link Road</li><li>Western Express Highway access</li><li>Employment centres across Mumbai&#8217;s western suburbs</li></ul><hr /><h1>Ruparel Realty – Developer Profile</h1><p>Ruparel Realty is a Mumbai-focused real estate developer established in 2000. Its current corporate website states that the company has delivered approximately <strong>2.10 million sq ft</strong>, has approximately <strong>8.67 million sq ft under delivery</strong>, and has delivered rehabilitation homes to around <strong>4,400 families</strong>. (<a title="Ruparel Realty - Real Estate Builder and Developer in Mumbai" href="https://ruparel.in/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Ruparel Realty</a>)</p><p>The developer&#8217;s current portfolio includes several projects in Kandivali West, including:</p><ul><li>Ruparel Westsky</li><li>Ruparel Optima</li><li>Ruparel Palacio</li><li>Ruparel Elara</li><li>Ruparel Skygreens</li></ul><p>The company&#8217;s current project directory confirms these Kandivali West projects and their respective configurations. (<a title="Luxury Flats and Apartments in Mumbai for Sale" href="https://ruparel.in/projects?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Ruparel Realty</a>)</p><p>This is useful for a West Park buyer because it provides several <strong>same-developer alternatives for comparison</strong>.</p><hr /><h1>Ruparel Codename West Park Location</h1><h2 id="toc-1-where-is-ruparel-codename-west-park">Where is Ruparel Codename West Park?</h2><p>The project&#8217;s historical brochure identifies the location as:</p><p><strong>CTS No. 471, Ekta Nagar, New Link Road, near Atharva College of Engineering, Kandivali West, Mumbai – 400067.</strong> (<a title="12X9_in_West Park Brochure" href="https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/1464348941931Codename-West-Park-_eBrochure.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Img StaticMB</a>)</p><p>The current business listing places Ruparel Codename West Park in the Kandivali/Charkop/Ganesh Nagar area of Kandivali West. Ruparel Codename West Park</p><p>The location gives residents access to the wider Kandivali–Malad–Goregaon–Borivali residential and employment belt.</p><hr /><h1>Location Advantages of Kandivali West</h1><h2 id="toc-2-1-new-link-road">1. New Link Road</h2><p>New Link Road is one of the major road corridors through Mumbai&#8217;s western suburbs.</p><p>It provides access toward:</p><p><strong>Borivali → Kandivali → Malad → Goregaon → Andheri</strong></p><p>This makes the micro-market particularly useful for residents working in western Mumbai.</p><p>The developer&#8217;s current Kandivali projects also highlight New Link Road as a key location advantage. Ruparel Westsky, for example, advertises New Link Road at approximately two minutes and Kandivali railway station at approximately ten minutes, subject to actual traffic conditions. (<a title="Ruparel Westsky - Luxurious 2 BHK Homes in Kandivali" href="https://ruparel.in/ruparel-westsky?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Ruparel Realty</a>)</p><hr /><h2 id="toc-3-2-kandivali-railway-station">2. Kandivali Railway Station</h2><p>Kandivali Railway Station is an important component of the western-suburban transport network.</p><p>For buyers commuting toward:</p><ul><li>Andheri</li><li>Bandra</li><li>Churchgate</li><li>Goregaon</li><li>Malad</li><li>Borivali</li></ul><p>the railway network remains a major advantage.</p><p>The exact travel time from West Park should be checked during peak hours rather than relying solely on marketing estimates.</p><hr /><h2 id="toc-4-3-mumbai-metro-connectivity">3. Mumbai Metro Connectivity</h2><p>Metro connectivity has become increasingly important for property values and daily commuting in Kandivali West.</p><p>The developer&#8217;s current Kandivali projects highlight nearby Metro access. Ruparel Westsky, for example, advertises Dahanukarwadi Metro Station at approximately two minutes from the project. (<a title="Ruparel Westsky - Luxurious 2 BHK Homes in Kandivali" href="https://ruparel.in/ruparel-westsky?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Ruparel Realty</a>)</p><p>For West Park, buyers should verify the <strong>actual route, walking distance and current operational status of the most convenient station</strong>.</p><hr /><h2 id="toc-5-4-western-express-highway">4. Western Express Highway</h2><p>Western Express Highway remains one of Mumbai&#8217;s most important north-south road corridors.</p><p>It connects Kandivali and the western suburbs with:</p><ul><li>Goregaon</li><li>Andheri</li><li>Vile Parle</li><li>Santacruz</li><li>Bandra</li><li>Airport-side areas</li><li>South Mumbai via connecting road networks</li></ul><p>Travel times can vary considerably during Mumbai&#8217;s peak traffic.</p><hr /><h1>Schools &amp; Educational Infrastructure</h1><p>Kandivali West and neighbouring western suburbs offer an established educational ecosystem.</p><p>The wider locality provides access to institutions such as:</p><ul><li>Ryan International School</li><li>Billabong International School</li><li>Thakur Education Institute</li><li>Atharva educational institutions</li><li>Colleges and professional institutes</li></ul><p>Ruparel&#8217;s current Kandivali project information lists several schools and educational institutions within the broader 3-km catchment of its Westsky development. (<a title="Ruparel Westsky - Luxurious 2 BHK Homes in Kandivali" href="https://ruparel.in/ruparel-westsky?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Ruparel Realty</a>)</p><p>For families, this established educational ecosystem is one of Kandivali West&#8217;s major advantages over newer peripheral markets.</p><hr /><h1>Healthcare Infrastructure</h1><p>The broader Kandivali–Malad–Borivali belt has numerous hospitals, clinics and diagnostic facilities.</p><p>The developer&#8217;s current Kandivali project information highlights healthcare facilities including:</p><ul><li>Shreeji Hospital</li><li>Oscar Hospital</li><li>Lotus Multispeciality Hospital</li><li>Nobel Hospital</li><li>Chavan Hospital</li></ul><p>Actual distance and travel time should be checked from the West Park building rather than assuming that the distances advertised for another nearby project are identical. (<a title="Ruparel Westsky - Luxurious 2 BHK Homes in Kandivali" href="https://ruparel.in/ruparel-westsky?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Ruparel Realty</a>)</p><hr /><h1>Shopping, Dining &amp; Entertainment</h1><p>Kandivali West has a mature retail and entertainment ecosystem.</p><p>Residents can access:</p><ul><li>Supermarkets</li><li>Restaurants</li><li>Cafés</li><li>Shopping centres</li><li>Multiplexes</li><li>Fitness centres</li><li>Sports facilities</li><li>Lifestyle stores</li></ul><p>The wider western-suburban catchment also provides access to destinations such as <strong>Infiniti Mall and Inorbit Mall</strong>. (<a title="Ruparel Westsky - Luxurious 2 BHK Homes in Kandivali" href="https://ruparel.in/ruparel-westsky?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Ruparel Realty</a>)</p><hr /><h1>Ruparel Codename West Park Apartment Configurations</h1><p>Current property databases primarily identify the project with <strong>1 BHK and 2 BHK apartments</strong>.</p><h2 id="toc-6-1-bhk-approximately-667-sq-ft">1 BHK – Approximately 667 sq ft</h2><p>The reported 667 sq ft 1 BHK is likely to appeal to:</p><ul><li>First-time homebuyers</li><li>Young professionals</li><li>Couples</li><li>Investors</li><li>Parents purchasing property for children</li></ul><h2 id="toc-7-2-bhk-approximately-815-sq-ft">2 BHK – Approximately 815 sq ft</h2><p>The 815 sq ft 2 BHK is a more conventional family configuration.</p><p>Potential buyers include:</p><ul><li>Young families</li><li>Upgrade buyers</li><li>Mumbai professionals</li><li>Investors targeting broader rental demand</li></ul><h2 id="toc-8-2-bhk-approximately-1072-sq-ft">2 BHK – Approximately 1,072 sq ft</h2><p>The larger 2 BHK provides additional space for buyers who want a larger living area without moving to a 3 BHK.</p><p>Current market data lists all three sizes. (<a title="Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West, Mumbai | Price List, Floor Plan, Reviews &amp; RERA Details" href="https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-codename-west-park/8557/project?utm_source=chatgpt.com">SquareYards</a>)</p><h3 id="toc-9-important-area-disclaimer">Important Area Disclaimer</h3><p>The online figures are not necessarily equivalent to <strong>RERA carpet area</strong>.</p><p>Before comparing two apartments, ask for:</p><p><strong>RERA carpet area + agreement area + balcony area + parking details + actual floor plan.</strong></p><p>A lower ₹/sq ft quote based on a larger saleable area can sometimes be misleading when compared with a carpet-area-based quotation.</p><hr /><h1>Ruparel Codename West Park Price in 2026</h1><p>This is the section that requires the greatest caution.</p><p>The original promotional material supplied for the project quoted approximately <strong>₹9,750/sq ft</strong>. That is historical launch-era information and should <strong>not</strong> be presented as the 2026 market price.</p><p>Current property-market information is considerably higher.</p><p>SquareYards reported that during <strong>Q1 2026</strong>, average property prices for Ruparel Codename West Park moved from approximately <strong>₹32,700/sq ft to ₹34,900/sq ft</strong>, a reported increase of approximately 6.73%. (<a title="Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West, Mumbai | Price List, Floor Plan, Reviews &amp; RERA Details" href="https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-codename-west-park/8557/project?utm_source=chatgpt.com">SquareYards</a>)</p><p>The same database lists indicative prices of:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Configuration</th><th align="right">Reported Area</th><th align="right">Indicative Listing Price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1 BHK</td><td align="right">667 sq ft</td><td align="right">~₹2.14 Cr</td></tr><tr><td>2 BHK</td><td align="right">815 sq ft</td><td align="right">~₹2.61 Cr</td></tr><tr><td>2 BHK</td><td align="right">1,072 sq ft</td><td align="right">~₹3.44 Cr</td></tr></tbody></table><p>These should be treated as <strong>indicative portal prices</strong>, not guaranteed transaction prices. (<a title="Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West, Mumbai | Price List, Floor Plan, Reviews &amp; RERA Details" href="https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-codename-west-park/8557/project?utm_source=chatgpt.com">SquareYards</a>)</p><h3 id="toc-10-what-can-change-the-actual-price">What Can Change the Actual Price?</h3><p>The final price of a particular West Park apartment can vary according to:</p><ul><li>Floor</li><li>View</li><li>Direction</li><li>Carpet area</li><li>Renovation</li><li>Interior quality</li><li>Parking</li><li>Building condition</li><li>Seller urgency</li><li>Unit availability</li><li>Loan outstanding</li><li>Society charges</li><li>Transaction structure</li></ul><p>Therefore, <strong>“Ruparel West Park price” should always be treated as a range until a specific apartment is identified.</strong></p><hr /><h1>Why the Old ₹9,750/sq ft Price Should Not Be Used</h1><p>The original West Park brochure is more than a decade old. It explicitly states that specifications, drawings, amenities and parameters were subject to change with approvals. (<a title="12X9_in_West Park Brochure" href="https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/1464348941931Codename-West-Park-_eBrochure.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Img StaticMB</a>)</p><p>Consequently, the following old information should not be republished as current without qualification:</p><ul><li>₹9,750/sq ft</li><li>Original pre-launch terminology</li><li>Old floor-rise schedules</li><li>Historical possession assumptions</li><li>Historical infrastructure proposals</li><li>Original unit inventory</li><li>Original amenity commitments</li></ul><p>This distinction is especially important for <strong>SEO and AIO content</strong>, because publishing obsolete prices as current can damage both user trust and search quality.</p><hr /><h1>Amenities at Ruparel Codename West Park</h1><p>The original West Park marketing material promoted an extensive lifestyle offering.</p><p>Reported amenities included:</p><ul><li>Clubhouse</li><li>Children&#8217;s play area</li><li>Gymnasium</li><li>Squash court</li><li>Football area</li><li>Table tennis</li><li>Snooker</li><li>Library</li><li>Spa</li><li>Beauty facilities</li><li>Aqua/fitness facilities</li><li>Cricket practice facilities</li><li>Green/open spaces</li><li>Parking</li><li>Security systems</li><li>High-speed elevators</li></ul><p>The original marketing material also highlighted:</p><ul><li>Solar lighting</li><li>Rainwater harvesting</li><li>Wastewater recycling</li><li>Green development initiatives</li></ul><h3 id="toc-11-2026-verification">2026 Verification</h3><p>Because these specifications originate from historical marketing material, <strong>the current operational status of individual amenities should be verified during a site visit</strong>.</p><p>This is especially important for a resale/ready-property purchase.</p><hr /><h1>Security &amp; Safety</h1><p>The original project material emphasised security and controlled access.</p><p>Reported features included:</p><ul><li>CCTV surveillance</li><li>Electronic security</li><li>Controlled entry</li><li>Card-access systems</li><li>Security personnel</li><li>High-speed elevators</li><li>Accessibility provisions</li></ul><p>For a 2026 buyer, inspect the actual building for:</p><ul><li>CCTV coverage</li><li>Security desk</li><li>Visitor management</li><li>Fire safety systems</li><li>Fire NOC</li><li>Emergency exits</li><li>Lift maintenance</li><li>Generator backup</li><li>Access control</li></ul><hr /><h1>Green Features</h1><p>The project&#8217;s original positioning emphasised greenery and environmental infrastructure.</p><p>The historical brochure/material referred to:</p><ul><li>Solar lighting</li><li>Rainwater harvesting</li><li>Wastewater recycling</li><li>Landscaped/open areas</li></ul><p>These features can be positive from a sustainability and common-area-management perspective.</p><p>However, buyers should verify whether these systems are <strong>currently operational, maintained and actually serving the building</strong>.</p><hr /><h1>Is Ruparel Codename West Park Ready to Move?</h1><p>Current property-market sources list Ruparel Codename West Park as a <strong>ready-to-move property</strong>. (<a title="Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West, Mumbai | Price List, Floor Plan, Reviews &amp; RERA Details" href="https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-codename-west-park/8557/project?utm_source=chatgpt.com">SquareYards</a>)</p><p>That is materially different from the old launch-era description of the project as a pre-launch opportunity.</p><p>For a ready/resale apartment, however, “ready to move” should not be the only verification.</p><h3 id="toc-12-ask-for">Ask for:</h3><ul><li>Occupancy Certificate</li><li>Completion documentation</li><li>Society documents</li><li>Registered agreement</li><li>Share certificate, where applicable</li><li>Property tax receipts</li><li>Maintenance receipts</li><li>No-dues certificate</li><li>Electricity bills</li><li>Seller title documents</li><li>Bank loan closure/NOC, if applicable</li></ul><hr /><h1>Ruparel Codename West Park Resale</h1><p>For buyers looking specifically for <strong>Ruparel West Park resale flats</strong>, the resale market can be attractive because buyers can inspect the actual apartment rather than purchasing purely from plans or artist impressions.</p><h3 id="toc-13-advantages-of-resale">Advantages of Resale</h3><ul><li>Actual apartment can be inspected</li><li>Actual view can be assessed</li><li>Building condition is visible</li><li>Society environment can be evaluated</li><li>Existing amenities can be checked</li><li>Possession is immediate/near-immediate</li><li>Negotiation may be possible</li></ul><h3 id="toc-14-things-to-watch">Things to Watch</h3><ul><li>Seller&#8217;s outstanding loan</li><li>Society transfer charges</li><li>Maintenance arrears</li><li>Property tax dues</li><li>Structural/monsoon issues</li><li>Renovation costs</li><li>Parking documentation</li><li>Title chain</li><li>Society share certificate</li><li>OC and approvals</li></ul><hr /><h1>Investment Potential</h1><h2 id="toc-15-why-kandivali-west-remains-an-investment-market">Why Kandivali West Remains an Investment Market</h2><p>Kandivali West is an <strong>established residential market</strong>, not a speculative peripheral location.</p><p>Its investment fundamentals include:</p><h3 id="toc-16-1-existing-population">1. Existing Population</h3><p>A large established residential population supports rental and resale demand.</p><h3 id="toc-17-2-transport-connectivity">2. Transport Connectivity</h3><p>Railway + road + Metro connectivity gives the area multiple commuting options.</p><h3 id="toc-18-3-employment-catchment">3. Employment Catchment</h3><p>Residents can access employment hubs across:</p><ul><li>Malad</li><li>Goregaon</li><li>Andheri</li><li>Western Express Highway corridor</li><li>Airport-side business districts</li><li>BKC-connected areas</li></ul><h3 id="toc-19-4-limited-land-availability">4. Limited Land Availability</h3><p>Established Mumbai suburbs have relatively limited developable land, creating long-term redevelopment and premiumisation potential.</p><p>However, <strong>limited land does not guarantee appreciation in an individual project</strong>.</p><hr /><h1>Rental Investment Potential</h1><p>The 1 BHK and 2 BHK formats can potentially appeal to:</p><ul><li>Working professionals</li><li>Couples</li><li>Small families</li><li>Corporate employees</li><li>Professionals working in Malad/Goregaon</li><li>Mumbai residents upgrading within the western suburbs</li></ul><p>For an investor, calculate:</p><p><strong>Gross Rental Yield = Annual Rent ÷ Total Acquisition Cost × 100</strong></p><p>Do not calculate yield using only the headline purchase price.</p><p>Include:</p><ul><li>Stamp duty</li><li>Registration</li><li>Brokerage</li><li>Interior cost</li><li>Maintenance</li><li>Property tax</li><li>Vacancy</li><li>Repairs</li><li>Financing costs</li></ul><hr /><h1>Who Should Buy Ruparel Codename West Park?</h1><h2 id="toc-20-best-suited-for-end-users">Best suited for End Users</h2><p>West Park may be suitable for buyers who prioritise:</p><ul><li>Kandivali West</li><li>Established infrastructure</li><li>Railway access</li><li>Metro connectivity</li><li>New Link Road</li><li>Ready/resale availability</li><li>1 BHK or 2 BHK layouts</li></ul><h2 id="toc-21-best-suited-for-investors">Best suited for Investors</h2><p>The project can be considered by investors seeking:</p><ul><li>Established western-suburban demand</li><li>Rental potential</li><li>Long-term holding</li><li>Resale liquidity</li><li>Connectivity-driven demand</li></ul><p>But the <strong>purchase price is critical</strong>.</p><p>A good property purchased at an excessive price can still produce a poor investment return.</p><hr /><h1>West Park vs New Projects in Kandivali West</h1><p>This is one of the most important comparisons for a 2026 buyer.</p><p>Ruparel&#8217;s current Kandivali portfolio includes <strong>Westsky, Optima, Palacio, Elara and Skygreens</strong>, providing potential alternatives within the same developer ecosystem. (<a title="Luxury Flats and Apartments in Mumbai for Sale" href="https://ruparel.in/projects?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Ruparel Realty</a>)</p><p>For example:</p><h3 id="toc-22-ruparel-westsky">Ruparel Westsky</h3><p>The developer currently markets Westsky as a <strong>59-storey 2 BHK tower</strong>, with amenities and connectivity around New Link Road and Dahanukarwadi Metro Station. (<a title="Ruparel Westsky - Luxurious 2 BHK Homes in Kandivali" href="https://ruparel.in/ruparel-westsky?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Ruparel Realty</a>)</p><h3 id="toc-23-ruparel-skygreens">Ruparel Skygreens</h3><p>The developer describes Skygreens as three 42-storey towers offering 1 and 2 BHK homes, with automated parking and gated security. (<a title="Ruparel Skygreen - 1 and 2 BHK Homes in Kandivali, Mumbai" href="https://ruparel.in/ruparel-skygreen?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Ruparel Realty</a>)</p><h3 id="toc-24-ruparel-palacio">Ruparel Palacio</h3><p>Palacio is positioned as a 42-storey premium 3 BHK development. (<a title="Ruparel Palacio - Premium 3 BHK Homes in Kandivali West" href="https://ruparel.in/ruparel-palacio?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Ruparel Realty</a>)</p><p>Therefore, a buyer considering West Park should compare:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Factor</th><th>West Park Resale</th><th>New Project</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Possession</td><td>Existing</td><td>Depends on project</td></tr><tr><td>Actual Apartment</td><td>Can inspect</td><td>Usually sample/plan</td></tr><tr><td>Negotiation</td><td>Potentially higher</td><td>Depends on developer</td></tr><tr><td>Construction Age</td><td>Older</td><td>Newer</td></tr><tr><td>Amenities</td><td>Existing</td><td>Modern/planned</td></tr><tr><td>Maintenance</td><td>Known</td><td>Future estimate</td></tr><tr><td>Location</td><td>Established</td><td>Depends on project</td></tr><tr><td>Price</td><td>Unit-specific</td><td>Developer-defined</td></tr><tr><td>Rental</td><td>Can estimate actual</td><td>Projection</td></tr><tr><td>Resale</td><td>Existing market evidence</td><td>Future-dependent</td></tr></tbody></table><hr /><h1>Key Pros of Ruparel Codename West Park</h1><h3 id="toc-25-%e2%9c%85-established-kandivali-west-location">✅ Established Kandivali West location</h3><p>The strongest argument for the project is the established neighbourhood.</p><h3 id="toc-26-%e2%9c%85-new-link-road-connectivity">✅ New Link Road connectivity</h3><p>Excellent relevance for western-suburban commuting.</p><h3 id="toc-27-%e2%9c%85-1-2-bhk-options">✅ 1 &amp; 2 BHK options</h3><p>Broad potential buyer and tenant base.</p><h3 id="toc-28-%e2%9c%85-ready-resale-opportunity">✅ Ready/resale opportunity</h3><p>Buyers can inspect the actual apartment and building.</p><h3 id="toc-29-%e2%9c%85-mature-social-infrastructure">✅ Mature social infrastructure</h3><p>Schools, hospitals, retail and entertainment are already established.</p><h3 id="toc-30-%e2%9c%85-railway-metro-ecosystem">✅ Railway + Metro ecosystem</h3><p>Multiple transport options improve long-term location utility.</p><hr /><h1>Potential Cons / Risks</h1><h3 id="toc-31-%e2%9a%a0%ef%b8%8f-older-project-information-online">⚠️ Older project information online</h3><p>Many websites still reproduce historical brochure information.</p><h3 id="toc-32-%e2%9a%a0%ef%b8%8f-conflicting-area-specifications">⚠️ Conflicting area specifications</h3><p>Saleable, built-up and carpet areas must be separated.</p><h3 id="toc-33-%e2%9a%a0%ef%b8%8f-historical-pricing-is-obsolete">⚠️ Historical pricing is obsolete</h3><p>The old ₹9,750/sq ft rate should not be used for 2026 valuation.</p><h3 id="toc-34-%e2%9a%a0%ef%b8%8f-resale-price-can-vary-significantly">⚠️ Resale price can vary significantly</h3><p>Floor, view, renovation and parking can materially affect pricing.</p><h3 id="toc-35-%e2%9a%a0%ef%b8%8f-building-condition-matters">⚠️ Building condition matters</h3><p>A ready property should be assessed physically rather than judged only by project branding.</p><h3 id="toc-36-%e2%9a%a0%ef%b8%8f-competing-projects">⚠️ Competing projects</h3><p>Kandivali West has multiple new and established residential developments, so buyers should compare before purchasing.</p><hr /><h1>2026 Buyer Due-Diligence Checklist</h1><p>Before paying a token amount, verify:</p><h3 id="toc-37-project-documentation">Project Documentation</h3><ul class="contains-task-list"><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> MahaRERA registration/project records</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Approved plans</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Occupancy Certificate</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Completion documentation</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Fire approvals</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Society documentation</li></ul><h3 id="toc-38-seller">Seller</h3><ul class="contains-task-list"><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Seller identity</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Title chain</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Registered agreement</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Share certificate</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Bank NOC, if financed</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Loan outstanding</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Property tax dues</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Society maintenance dues</li></ul><h3 id="toc-39-apartment">Apartment</h3><ul class="contains-task-list"><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> RERA carpet area</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Actual usable area</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Floor</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> View</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Direction</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Natural light</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Ventilation</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Leakage/dampness</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Renovation requirements</li></ul><h3 id="toc-40-financial">Financial</h3><ul class="contains-task-list"><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Final consideration</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Stamp duty</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Registration</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Brokerage</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Maintenance</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Corpus</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Society transfer charges</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Parking cost</li><li class="task-list-item"><input disabled="disabled" type="checkbox" /> Loan processing cost</li></ul><hr /><h1>Is Ruparel Codename West Park Worth Buying in 2026?</h1><h3 id="toc-41-for-an-end-user-potentially-yes">For an end-user: <strong>Potentially yes</strong></h3><p>West Park deserves consideration if you want an established Kandivali West address and find a well-maintained apartment at a competitive market price.</p><h3 id="toc-42-for-an-investor-price-sensitive-buy">For an investor: <strong>Price-sensitive buy</strong></h3><p>The location is attractive, but the investment case depends on:</p><p><strong>Purchase price + rental income + holding period + resale liquidity + maintenance + competing supply.</strong></p><h3 id="toc-43-for-a-family-strong-location-proposition">For a family: <strong>Strong location proposition</strong></h3><p>The established social infrastructure and western-suburban connectivity are meaningful advantages.</p><h3 id="toc-44-for-a-first-time-buyer-compare-carefully">For a first-time buyer: <strong>Compare carefully</strong></h3><p>If the budget permits, compare West Park against newer Kandivali West projects before deciding whether the premium for newer construction is justified.</p><hr /><h1>Final Verdict</h1><p><strong>Ruparel Codename West Park should be evaluated in 2026 as an established Kandivali West residential/resale opportunity—not as the pre-launch project described in old promotional material.</strong></p><p>Its key advantages are its <strong>Kandivali West location, New Link Road access, established neighbourhood infrastructure, railway connectivity, Metro ecosystem and availability of 1 BHK and 2 BHK formats</strong>.</p><p>The biggest mistake a buyer can make is to rely on old online advertisements for price, configuration or amenities.</p><p>The correct 2026 buying process is:</p><p><strong>Identify the exact apartment → verify RERA carpet area → inspect the building → check OC/title/society documents → establish the current market value → compare 3–5 competing properties → negotiate the final consideration.</strong></p><p>Current market data indicates that West Park&#8217;s 2026 pricing is substantially above its historical launch-era pricing, with one March 2026 market database reporting an average movement from approximately ₹32,700/sq ft to ₹34,900/sq ft during Q1 2026. (<a title="Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West, Mumbai | Price List, Floor Plan, Reviews &amp; RERA Details" href="https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-codename-west-park/8557/project?utm_source=chatgpt.com">SquareYards</a>)</p><p><strong>For a good unit at the right price, Ruparel Codename West Park can be a practical Kandivali West end-user and investment option.</strong></p><hr /><h1>Frequently Asked Questions – Ruparel Codename West Park</h1><h2 id="toc-45-what-is-ruparel-codename-west-park">What is Ruparel Codename West Park?</h2><p>Ruparel Codename West Park is a residential project by Ruparel Realty in Kandivali West, Mumbai.</p><h2 id="toc-46-where-is-ruparel-codename-west-park-located">Where is Ruparel Codename West Park located?</h2><p>The historical project address is <strong>CTS No. 471, Ekta Nagar, New Link Road, near Atharva College of Engineering, Kandivali West, Mumbai – 400067</strong>. (<a title="12X9_in_West Park Brochure" href="https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/1464348941931Codename-West-Park-_eBrochure.pdf?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Img StaticMB</a>)</p><h2 id="toc-47-what-flats-are-available-at-ruparel-codename-west-park">What flats are available at Ruparel Codename West Park?</h2><p>Current property databases list <strong>1 BHK and 2 BHK apartments</strong>. (<a title="Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West, Mumbai | Price List, Floor Plan, Reviews &amp; RERA Details" href="https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-codename-west-park/8557/project?utm_source=chatgpt.com">SquareYards</a>)</p><h2 id="toc-48-what-are-the-apartment-sizes">What are the apartment sizes?</h2><p>Reported sizes include approximately <strong>667 sq ft, 815 sq ft and 1,072 sq ft</strong>. Buyers should verify RERA carpet area separately. (<a title="Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West, Mumbai | Price List, Floor Plan, Reviews &amp; RERA Details" href="https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-codename-west-park/8557/project?utm_source=chatgpt.com">SquareYards</a>)</p><h2 id="toc-49-what-is-ruparel-west-parks-price-in-2026">What is Ruparel West Park&#8217;s price in 2026?</h2><p>Current portal data indicates project-level rates around the <strong>₹32,000–₹35,000/sq ft range</strong> during Q1 2026, but individual apartment prices vary. (<a title="Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West, Mumbai | Price List, Floor Plan, Reviews &amp; RERA Details" href="https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-codename-west-park/8557/project?utm_source=chatgpt.com">SquareYards</a>)</p><h2 id="toc-50-is-the-%e2%82%b99750-sq-ft-price-still-valid">Is the ₹9,750/sq ft price still valid?</h2><p><strong>No.</strong> That figure comes from historical launch-era material and should not be treated as a 2026 price.</p><h2 id="toc-51-is-ruparel-codename-west-park-ready-to-move">Is Ruparel Codename West Park ready to move?</h2><p>Current property-market data reports the project as ready to move. Buyers should independently verify OC and other building documents. (<a title="Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West, Mumbai | Price List, Floor Plan, Reviews &amp; RERA Details" href="https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-codename-west-park/8557/project?utm_source=chatgpt.com">SquareYards</a>)</p><h2 id="toc-52-is-ruparel-west-park-good-for-investment">Is Ruparel West Park good for investment?</h2><p>It can be considered because of Kandivali West&#8217;s established residential market and connectivity, but the investment case depends heavily on the acquisition price and expected rental/resale return.</p><h2 id="toc-53-is-kandivali-west-a-good-place-to-buy-a-2-bhk">Is Kandivali West a good place to buy a 2 BHK?</h2><p>Kandivali West is an established western-suburban market with residential, educational, healthcare, retail and transportation infrastructure. A 2 BHK can suit both end-users and investors, subject to budget and exact micro-location.</p><h2 id="toc-54-which-is-better-ruparel-west-park-resale-or-a-new-kandivali-project">Which is better: Ruparel West Park resale or a new Kandivali project?</h2><p>West Park can make sense if the resale is attractively priced and the building/apartment is in good condition. A new project may offer newer construction and modern amenities. The correct choice depends on the price differential and buyer&#8217;s possession timeline.</p><hr /><h1>SEO Strategy for SarthakEstates.com</h1><h3 id="toc-55-primary-keyword">Primary Keyword</h3><p><strong>Ruparel Codename West Park Kandivali West</strong